  "summary": "User Mei Chen (user_id 9, Operations, Logistics Analyst, device BL-LT-0109 macOS 15) reports Excel shows \"Unlicensed Product\" at the top and blocks editing. Checks: account active, not locked, 0 failed logins, must_change_password false, password last set 2026-09-11, not blocked. Sign-in logs for the last 14 days show all M365 and VPN sign-ins succeeded with Duo push MFA from Chicago (corporate network for m365), so she is signing in correctly with her company account. Laptop online, disk 14.6% free, no warnings. Per KB-026 escalation condition (signs in correctly but still sees Unlicensed product), this likely means the Microsoft 365 license is not assigned or not activating. Needed: verify the M365 license assignment for mei.chen@brightline.example and reassign if missing; check Office activation on BL-LT-0109. Also note mailbox is 99.4% full (50.9 GB of 51.2 GB), which may need attention separately. Tier 1 did not ask the user to run the sign-out/restart steps from KB-026 yet, since sign-in is confirmed and the escalation condition applies.",
  "reason": "KB-026 escalation condition met: user signs in correctly but still sees Unlicensed product; license assignment needs Tier 2 verification."
}

{
  "outcome": "escalated",
  "reply_to_user": "Hi Mei, thanks for reporting this. I checked your account and your recent sign-ins look normal, so you are signing in correctly with your company account. The 'Unlicensed Product' message usually means the Microsoft 365 license isn't active on your account, which needs a closer check. I've passed your ticket to our Tier 2 team, who will verify your license and Office activation on your laptop. Please keep your work saved, and let us know if Excel stops working altogether. Separately, your mailbox is almost full (about 99%), so you may want to clear out some large emails or attachments while we look into it.",
  "internal_note": "Checked lookup_user (user_id 9): account active, not locked, 0 failed logins, not blocked, password last set 2026-09-11. Sign-in logs (14 days): all M365 and VPN sign-ins succeeded with Duo push MFA, no failures. Device BL-LT-0109 (macOS 15) online, 14.6% disk free, no warnings. Per KB-026 escalation condition (user signs in correctly but still sees Unlicensed product), escalated to Tier 2 as escalation_id 1. Tier 2 should verify the M365 license assignment and Office activation. Sign-out/restart steps from KB-026 were not requested from the user since sign-in is confirmed. Mailbox is 99.4% full (50890/51200 MB), flagged for follow-up.",
